            "@type": "Answer",
            text: "At 3 mph, about 3,400 steps for a typical adult, based on an average cadence of about 114 steps per minute measured on a treadmill in the CADENCE-Adults study. Most people land between about 3,200 and 3,600. If your treadmill shows km/h, speed 3 is only about 1.9 mph and works out nearer 2,800 steps.",
          },
